ntified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m007-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"辛甲","kind":"person","person_id":"wdr_m9a_k1r","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","text":"其明日，除道，修社及商紂宮。及期，百夫荷罕旗以先驅。武王弟叔振鐸奉陳常車，周公旦把大鉞，畢公把小鉞，以夾武王。散宜生、太顛、閎夭皆執劍以衛武王。既入，立于社南大卒之左，右畢從。毛叔鄭奉明水，衛康叔封布茲，召公奭贊采，師尚父牽牲。尹佚筴祝曰：「殷之末孫季紂，殄廢先王明德，侮蔑神祇不祀，昏暴商邑百姓，其章顯聞于天皇上帝。」於是武王再拜稽首，曰：「膺更大命，革殷，受天明命。」武王又再拜稽首，乃出。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"商紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"叔振鐸","kind":"person","person_id":"f1l_p1w_796","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"周公旦","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"畢公","kind":"person","person_id":"ngh_196_gz6","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"散宜生","kind":"person","person_id":"1dm_ebc_uzk","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"太顛","kind":"person","person_id":"5pr_wl7_dk1","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"閎夭","kind":"person","person_id":"hv8_0ce_lw9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id"